msgctxt "108"
msgid "Phew, that was a good workout."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Well, Akira-kun? That was pretty fun, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Then we're done warming up! Time to play for real!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "...For real?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Yup. We don't have enough people for a game or anything,\r\n"
"but we take turns at bat and everyone else plays defense!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Where should we put Akira-kun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "How about right field? It's the perfect spot for beginners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Good idea. Everyone get into position!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "W-Wait, what's right field?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Seriously? You don't know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Lay off him, Taichi. It's his first time, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Right field's over there. Pretty far from the batter."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Just stand back there and get the ball if it comes your way.\r\n"
"Then throw it to Mitsuo, okay? You'll be fine, Akira-kun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"All you need is a little confidence, Akira. Just believe in\r\n"
"yourself. Anyway, I'm gonna head inside for a bit. Keep an\r\n"
"eye on him, Koji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Will do! Let's get you in position, Akira-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "(Hm? I don't recognize that kid.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Hey, do you live around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Y-Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Cool! I'm Koji! What's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "It's Akira."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Well, Akira, you wanna play with us? You know how to play baseball, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "I, um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "C'mon, it'll be fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Yeah, let's play!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "But... I've never played before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"I bet I'm really bad at it, just like I'm bad at everything\r\n"
"else. PE's the only time I play sports, and even then I\r\n"
"always get picked last..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Don't worry, we'll teach you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "We were just saying how we needed another guy, c'mon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "We've got two girls and five boys, so one more boy'll even out the teams!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Right, Taichi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Yeah, we'd love for you to join!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Some of the other kids are pretty young, too, so we won't\r\n"
"go too hard, promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "All right, maybe I could play a bit. Thanks!"
msgstr ""

